{"seq":2,"slug":"strategic-management-grad","title":"战略管理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad","introMarkdown":"# 战略管理 简介\n\n战略管理是管理学研究的高阶领域，关注企业如何在复杂竞争环境中获取和维持竞争优势。研究生阶段的战略管理学习要求超越工具性的分析框架，深入理解战略理论的核心逻辑、实证检验和边界条件。\n\n本课程从理论基础出发，经由竞争分析和公司战略，最终拓展到战略前沿专题，构建从经典到当代的理论谱系。\n\n第一章**战略管理理论**追溯战略管理研究的理论根基，讲解资源基础观对企业异质性和持续竞争优势的解释、动态能力理论在快速变化环境中的适用性，以及制度理论如何揭示组织战略行为受社会规范和制度压力影响的机制。\n\n第二章**竞争战略分析**聚焦产业层面和企业层面的竞争分析工具与理论，涵盖产业结构分析与竞争格局判断、竞争优势的来源类型和可持续性条件，以及蓝海战略通过价值创新重构市场边界的逻辑。\n\n第三章**公司战略**讨论多元化企业在业务组合、组织边界和全球化布局方面的战略选择，包括多元化的动因与绩效、战略联盟和网络组织的治理机制，以及全球战略中本地响应与全球整合的平衡。\n\n第四章**战略前沿专题**关注数字经济时代涌现的新型战略形态，分析平台商业模式的网络效应和治理挑战、生态系统战略中价值共创与互补者管理的机制，以及可持续发展对传统战略框架的延伸和重塑。\n\n建议学习者在研读理论文献时同步跟踪企业实践案例，战略管理的理论抽象度较高，与真实商业情境的对照分析是深化理解的有效途径。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"战略管理理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"resource-based-view","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 资源基础观","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/foundations/resource-based-view"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-capabilities","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 动态能力","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/foundations/dynamic-capabilities"},{"seq":3,"slug":"institutional-theory-strategy","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 制度理论与战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/foundations/institutional-theory-strategy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"competitive","title":"竞争战略分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/competitive","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industry-analysis","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 产业分析与竞争格局","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/competitive/industry-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"competitive-advantage","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 竞争优势的来源与持续性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/competitive/competitive-advantage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"blue-ocean-strategy","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 蓝海战略与价值创新","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/competitive/blue-ocean-strategy"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"corporate","title":"公司战略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/corporate","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"diversification-strategy","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 多元化战略与公司范围","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/corporate/diversification-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"alliance-networks","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 战略联盟与网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/corporate/alliance-networks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-strategy","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 全球战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/corporate/global-strategy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"emerging","title":"战略前沿专题","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/emerging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-strategy","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 平台战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/emerging/platform-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ecosystem-strategy","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 生态系统战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/emerging/ecosystem-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainability-strategy","title":"研究生 战略管理 — 可持续发展战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/strategic-management-grad/emerging/sustainability-strategy"}]}]}